WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.560
Diagnosing the risk is only the first
step.

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.240
The next is deploying structural
solutions.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.320
This graphic details the four pillars of
methodological mitigation.

4
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.620
Rigorous scientific methodology acts as
the first required line of defense.

5
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.140
It starts with open science, mandating
public repositories and

6
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:24.500
preregistration. Second is replication,
requiring dedicated peer replication

7
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.340
to prove findings hold up. Third is
transparency.

8
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.660
Implementing open peer review systems
eliminates the shadows where unethical

9
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.720
practices thrive. Finally, auditing.

10
00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:40.440
This involves red team exercises,
proactively attacking your own data and

11
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.380
methodologies to locate weaknesses before
publication.

12
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:47.560
These four methodological pillars strip
away the opportunity for both

13
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.140
accidental error and intentional malice.

14
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.360
But methodological rules are entirely
useless if the humans operating them

15
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.220
feel unsafe, marginalized, or coerced.

16
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.220
This brings us to the final interlocking
mechanisms required to protect the

17
00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.820
human element of research. At the top,
strict safety policies must include

18
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:09.240
anonymous reporting channels and severe
anti-retaliation measures.

19
00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:14.020
bottom left, formal mentorship systems
diffuse concentrated power dynamics.

20
00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:18.440
And on the right, inclusive governance and
rotating leadership prevent the

21
00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:22.000
institutional complacency we saw at the
base of the iceberg.

22
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:26.300
Securing both the data and the people who
generate it relies on a deep

23
00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:29.100
architectural commitment to these systemic
safeguards.

24
00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:33.840
Mastering these interconnected frameworks
provides the accountability and

25
00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.700
resilience necessary to preserve long-term
public trust in the research

26
00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:38.740
enterprise.
